    <command xml:space="preserve">x control panel</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A small control panel with a row of four buttons and LEDs above them. The LEDs currently look like this:

[off] [off] [off] [off] 

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
