  <item nodeId="node-0x55987639da20">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Ozymandias
Two vast and trunkless legs of stone stand in the desert. Near them on the sand, half sunk, a shattered visage lies. The legs are atop a pedestal.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>YES</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x5598763a1030"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x5598763a1030">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look at legs</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Vast stone legs extend upwards, but whatever torso once existed atop them is long gone now, obliterated by the cruel passage of endless ages.Atop the left leg, resplendent in its glory, sits the kingfisher. Atop the right leg, tiny but audacious, sits the goldcrest.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>YES</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
  </item>
