  <item nodeId="node-0x5598764dfa90">
    <command xml:space="preserve">give ruby to ghost on the left</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The ghost takes the ruby and looks at it inquisitively. He holds it close. His expression does not change. &quot;I appreciate the offer,&quot; he says, &quot;but I don&apos;t think this helps.&quot; The ghost hands the ruby back to you.

&gt;</result>
