  <item nodeId="node-0x55987652f350">
    <command xml:space="preserve">give malachite to ghost on the left</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The ghost takes the malachite and looks at it inquisitively. He holds it close. You can see his emotional barriers breaking down. He looks at you and very slowly starts to smile. &quot;I... I see now that I had no choice. I was a victim as much as they were. If I had not killed them I would have been killed myself. I see a long road ahead...&quot; He looks at you, a single tear rolling down his cheek as he smiles, the relief obvious in his face. &quot;But... I think I am beginning to forgive myself.&quot;

The ghost slowly begins to dissolve and rise upwards into the desert sky. Where he stood, an ornate tombstone with a roman numeral carved into it rests on the ground.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
