  <item nodeId="node-0x55987655dff0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">give malachite to ghost on the right</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The ghost takes the malachite and looks at it inquisitively. He holds it close. His expression does not change. &quot;This is worthless to me!&quot; he spits, &quot;why don&apos;t you give me something useful?.&quot; The ghost throws the malachite back at you. You pick it up and put it in your pocket.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>YES</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x559876561410"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x559876561410">
    <command xml:space="preserve">give unakite to the ghost on the right</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(first taking the unakite)
The ghost takes the unakite and looks at it inquisitively. He holds it close. You see his anger start to fade. Slowly he sits down. &quot;I... I&apos;ve been so angry.&quot; He says, his hands shaking. &quot;So angry for so long. My rage was consuming me. But I can see now that it&apos;s holding me back. None of it has made things better... It just ate away at me, prevented me from growing.&quot; He looks up at you. &quot;Thank you. you have given me a moment of clarity, enough to see that this hatred solves nothing. I have a long way to go, and I&apos;m not sure I can forgive the people who did this to me, at least not yet; but I will no longer let their wrongs control me.&quot; The frown on the ghost&apos;s face slowly fades and is replaced by the first hint of a smile. You watch as he relaxes for the first time in a thousand years.

The ghost slowly begins to dissolve and rise upwards into the desert sky. Where he stood, a carved tombstone with a roman numeral carved into it rests on the ground.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>YES</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x559876564d60"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x559876564d60">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Arena of Champions
You stand inside a vast arena, and for a brief moment experience a vision of an ancient time, the stalls filled with thousands of people cheering on the mighty warriors who clashed on the sands. As suddenly as it appeared, the vision fades, and the stalls lie empty, filling the arena with an unsettling silence. A plinth of alabaster occupies the centre of the arena.

You can see a tombstone on the right of the plinth, a ghost on the left of the plinth and a Ghost behind the plinth here.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>YES</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x559876568170"/>
    </children>
  </item>
