    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x55987658c2c0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x stream</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A gentle stream flows over the rock between you and the cavern entrance before flowing over the edge of the cliff. There are various points where the water is shallow enough for you to hop across.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>YES</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x55987658f9f0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x55987658f9f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ne</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">
Cavern
The cavern feels surprisingly cosy inside. Instead of bare rock, the walls are covered in a variety of tapestries and paintings. Hessian carpet covers the floor. Around the edges of the cavern walls are pieces of hand-crafted wooden furniture: a bed; a nightstand; a wardrobe. In the centre of the cavern, near a log burning stove, is a luxurious looking chair. An old man sits on the chair, looking out at the sunset to the southwest with a contented smile on his face.

On the chair is The Old Man of the Mountain.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>YES</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x5598765933b0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x5598765933b0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">say giraffe to the old man</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">&quot;No,&quot; says the old man, &quot;I don&apos;t think that&apos;s one of my missing memories.&quot;

&gt;</result>
