    <result xml:space="preserve">&quot;Ahhhh yes,&quot; says the old man, a wistful look in his eyes. &quot;One of my fondest memories. I kept her safe for a time. Showed her some of the things her inventions helped create. Here&apos;s some knowledge for you: Page 33.&quot;

&gt;</result>
